            "text": "{\"task\":{\"created_at\":\"2026-11-09T23:15:44.099325Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-09T23:15:44.099325Z\",\"org_id\":\"01a1c297-bef8-7203-beab-95d726359bd1\",\"project_id\":\"01a1c297-bf36-7395-a5b9-c8a0733c3d82\",\"id\":\"01a1c298-9d61-7243-8007-9cfb477817db\",\"title\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo…\",\"display_index\":6,\"status\":\"pending\",\"kind\":\"agent\",\"member_id\":\"01a1c297-bf09-7057-bb4f-03d7bb522ce9\",\"automation_id\":null,\"runtime_group_id\":\"01a1c297-ea58-7534-87b5-690feea518b5\",\"runtime_id\":\"01a1c298-71f0-7385-b56e-2fb881418f68\",\"is_archived\":false,\"started_at\":null,\"completed_at\":null,\"last_user_message_at\":\"2026-11-09T23:15:44.100076Z\",\"metadata\":{\"error\":null,\"suite\":\"walk\",\"walk_run\":\"6af253eb-f07b\",\"agent_name\":\"scripted\",\"task_prompt\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER_6AF253EB_F07B` in the shell and reply in one short sentence.\\n\\n<<SCRIPT {\\\"reply\\\":\\\"Echoed the message through hello-mcp and wrote it to the outputs file.\\\",\\\"tools\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hello-mcp_echo\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Echo: hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"command\\\":\\\"echo $WALK_MARKER_6AF253EB_F07B\\\"}}]}>>\",\"active_run_id\":\"01a1c298-9d61-7243-8007-9cfa80234f14\",\"latest_run_id\":\"01a1c298-9d61-7243-8007-9cfa80234f14\",\"crash_restarts\":null,\"history_recall