 path=\\\"/workspace/outputs\\\" persistence=\\\"task\\\" />\\n  Save downloaded source material under files/ and deliverables under outputs/. Mounted uploads and recipe files remain read-only; use a new path for modified copies.\\n</workspace>\\nUploaded inputs are read-only. Put intentional task deliverables in the outputs path so the platform can persist them.\\n\\n\\n## Session\\n\\n<session visibility=\\\"project\\\">\\n  <permissions plane=\\\"data\\\">annotations:read conversations:read events:read files:read files:write metrics:read shares:read shares:write tasks:read tasks:write repositories:write telemetry:write git:read</permissions>\\n</session>\\n\\n<cwd>\\n/workspace\\n</cwd>\\n\\n<current_date>\\nToday is Monday, November 9, 2026 (2026-11-09), in UTC (UTC+00:00). Read dates the person gives, such as \\\"tomorrow\\\", in this time zone.\\n</current_date>\"}]},\"introspection\":{\"agent\":{\"depth\":\"0\",\"kind\":\"session\"},\"byok\":false,\"contains\":{\"values\":[\"gen_ai.input.messages.role:user\",\"gen_ai.output.messages.parts.type:tool_call\",\"gen_ai.output.messages.parts.name:hello-mcp_echo\"],\"version\":2},\"environment\":\"production\",\"history\":{\"continuation_method\":\"conversation_id\",\"is_new\":true,\"new_messages\":{\"end\":1,\"start\":0},\"position\":1},\"ingest\":{\"host\":\"b95fa995c19f\",\"time\":1794266145808688},\"member\":{\"id\":\"01a1c297-bf09-7057-bb4f-03d7bb522ce9\"},\"org\":{\"id\":\"01a1c297-bef8-7203-beab-95d726359bd1\"},\"project\":{\"id\":\"01a1c297-bf36-7395-a5b9-c8a0733c3d82\"},\"recipe\":{\"git_commit_sha\":\"4ba23a7e00c4b332f72ecdbdffd2a8294a0e23c7\"},\"run\":{\"id\":\"01a1c298-9d61-7243-8007-9cfa80234f14\",\"root_id\":\"01a1c298-9d61-7243-8007-9cfa80234f14\"},\"runtime\":{\"group_id\":\"01a1c297-ea58-7534-87b5-690feea518b5\",\"id\":\"01a1c298-71f0-7385-b56e-2fb881418f68\"},\"task\":{\"id\":\"01a1c298-9d61-7243-8007-9cfb477817db\",\"run_id\":\"01a1c298-9d61-7243-8007-9cfa80234f14\"},\"tool_call_ids\":[\"call_c724